The PNG filter definitions (None, Sub, Up, Average, Paeth) follow the PNG
specification (W3C). The screening approach — colour-type reduction, palette
orderings, per-row filter choice weighed by zlib, brute force by row — follows
the published description of the contest's own scale compressor in the
competition kit (make.fun, MIT).
